  "worked_solution": "Using the sum and constant multiple rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3e(x)+n(x))=3{e}^{\u2032}(x)+{n}^{\u2032}(x).\n$$\n\nAt the point where $x=-5$, this gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3e(x)+n(x))|}_{x=-5} & =3{e}^{\u2032}(-5)+{n}^{\u2032}(-5) \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-6)+9 \\\\  & =-18+9 \\\\  & =-9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
